11
00:00:53.326 --> 00:00:55.520
Mogao sam vidjeti drugi način postojanja.

12
00:01:14.773 --> 00:01:17.760
- Samo želim protegnuti noge.
- Neka bude brzo.

13
00:01:21.559 --> 00:01:23.720
Naravno. majko. Bit ću brz.

14
00:01:26.280 --> 00:01:27.760
Ann!

15
00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:29.720
Mary!

16
00:01:34.613 --> 00:01:35.953
Što radiš ovdje?

17
00:01:35.974 --> 00:01:38.339
Pratim Gardinerove.
Putovali smo do Jezera.

18
00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:40.866
Što radiš ovdje?

19
00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:43.960
Mary. imamo o mnogo čemu razgovarati.

20
00:01:45.406 --> 00:01:47.906
Majka i ja smo se
odmarale u gostionici.

21
00:01:47.993 --> 00:01:49.973
Idemo kući u
Nottingham na dva tjedna.

22
00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:53.193
Ali što je s gospodinom
Haywardom i vama?

23
00:01:53.247 --> 00:01:55.640
Jesu li se na kraju zaručili?

24
00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:58.060
Zapravo. Mary. g. Hayward i

25
00:01:58.199 --> 00:02:00.999
